WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.170
Every merge you've ever done…

2
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.330
…deserved better.

3
00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:19.090
Meet Footlit.

4
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.520
GitHub, with stage lighting.

5
00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:23.910
Pick a theme.

6
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.470
Create a repo.

7
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.170
And the show begins.

8
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:34.440
Break the build.

9
00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:37.380
And the show stops.

10
00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:41.040
Fix it.

11
00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:42.090
Merge it.

12
00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:44.120
Take a bow.

13
00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:46.400
Eleven events.

14
00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:47.560
Six themes.

15
00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:49.570
Zero data leaves your browser.

16
00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:54.426
Footlit. Free for Chrome and Firefox.

